"нажмите **Сохранить**"
msgstr "To apply the default document rights, click **Save**."

#: ../../settings_kb/data_types/data_types_attributes.rst:426
msgid "Права на атрибут:"
msgstr "Attribute rights:"

#: ../../settings_kb/data_types/data_types_attributes.rst:440
