msgstr "The main logic is located in the **ecos-model-lib** library."

#: ../../settings_kb/data_types/data_types_attributes.rst:583
msgid "Конфигурация прав хранится в микросервисе **ecos-model**."
msgstr "The rights configuration is stored in the **ecos-model** microservice."

